# Dockerfile.dev copies the dependency files only, and the Makefile mounts the
# source at run time. So the build context stays at three files, and the 400 MB
# of data/ and the 40 MB of .git never go to the Docker daemon.
#
# Add an exception line here for each new file that a Dockerfile must COPY.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!.npmrc
